null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_32","text":"If you want to grow to enjoy conversation, you need to talk more often. Make a joke, and I'll let you know if it's funny.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_33","text":"Fighting is something you'll come to appreciate the more you do it. You're even better at hand-to-hand combat than you are at shooting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_34","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_35","text":"Red Hood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_36","text":"Yeah?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun2_02_e_37","text":"I would appreciate it if you didn't force your personal preferences upon me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foo